    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89d7d97b581a53746e3a3267",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员。\r\n新宇宙没能『回应』你的期待……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c17f2725c44c6c272ed1873e152d7fcec868375c93a803aac4242b09ec2bd765",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d0214aba6eb5e4c11fd4dc6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我以笑容回答新宇宙的话语。\r\n至少我们一同挑战过了——\r\n只要这样想的话，我心中的不甘便烟消云散。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91878b4fc8d9386f085fa64f5ac8d964b3219a02f1079a913c5365af7885c17f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25deafefed9cf329ac8ea7d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花賞の後に・勇者への微波",
      "source_fingerprint": "c72fcc66c810063664baa543d9ec66b8a82c0e961c20a9972c5fc1c364c0338a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105314.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00fd81f0a077e8a6cc84fc77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙与荒漠英雄发挥出各自的全部实力，\r\n全力相争。\r\n不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fd100706fc0edc511f7097a5552f85a547a38827574bb81747cff50da430836",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105315.json",
