    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc385c9d9dadab53d1e90901",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员。新宇宙有件事情很『担心』。\r\n关于训练员的资格……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64c23d975db657a49c20f8730d9eeb8bf929d40443a3b5b1e2089710f18fade",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ff9f1e984645f77616ed55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我告诉她，『已经想办法解决了』。\r\n毕竟我的行为也并非是出于恶意……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bfbc2f25ed573c4c9542aae23674cf5d6166d266a1bd6cebfa0268b9ab4e51f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c9f99e127102c4d4cec666f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后的处置结果只是简单的批评教育。\r\nURA也并不是什么毫无人情味的组织啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de5544aa849b4b68bdcd84cfaaeacb4634442279ec93a8ea780000b0e48df35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8bd2edfcbc9fb230aef89b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
