    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d6c4561a36349595f43445",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样吗……\r\n那么，这个“星间宙域”——通过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a92064746c9f98a4c86318fcf96ef0033c5b224d3102591e75159aa3cbc36b01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd5e9878fac8b0938e3069e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在经历这一次历练之后，\r\n我感觉我与新宇宙的情谊进一步加深了。\r\n照这个状态的话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f8a3cc778d901e9af0e16177aca99833d69f73071dec735d24e60fe1a0f9fd9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
