      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈……哈……这就是『菊花赏』……\r\n虽有些败北的不甘……\r\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "807aa75f43a2830d448b56aa8b783ec98448842d4e49dc9ca7893889056b687f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
