      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:855846c39b30f4dbe48d2c3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以心传心。\r\n看她的表情，大概也是想在『天皇赏（春）』之\r\n前先参加一场别的比赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30f9a845bf370529eb33d8c68f6b6de5c67e577fea5bff77feda7eacc61ef72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5db06f045589d558b233ab72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而可选的比赛里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d99cea6eadff517b4e828f1a892906a0aaed38c8cd926e3857e40c9d9cf4443f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fb2342005bcd0792cb4bf4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "根据今天的表现来看，长距离比赛对她而言仍然\r\n是个过重的负担。\r\n既然这样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0d3ad2728d6a02e05a522a6d1e8e1a65e70cfcde6a81daba22c0b147b9773af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a7695c194e9d3ef6a87ddc9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在距离已是中距离上限的『日本杯』中，\r\n与古马级的对手们相互竞争，\r\n积累经验比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d07ded845ec0b8bf6cb3f968aece491e2d584db226c4e23341ac4cb20bf27bad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105315.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8a3e738f1325981f9208df0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4d688f71d8c38a8a2d9ef98cb402b044f0892dc958bfddf71ec65b7b37fbf2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
